---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About ARMS"
  description="About the ARMS Laboratory, its mission and experimental capabilities at UC Davis."
  current="/about/"
>
  <section class="section narrow detail-intro" id="about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About ARMS</p>
    <h1>
      Manufacturing research.
      <br />
      Developing researchers.
    </h1>
    <p>
      Founded by Professor Masakazu Soshi in January 2013, the Advanced Research
      for Manufacturing Systems (ARMS) Laboratory studies CNC machine tools,
      machining processes, and additive manufacturing. Today, our research
      focuses on Agentic Manufacturing and machining/DED hybrid manufacturing,
      bringing together software, machines, and experiments to address
      manufacturing challenges.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section split capabilities">
    <figure>
      <img
        src="/images/cmm.webp"
        srcset="/images/cmm-720.webp 720w, /images/cmm.webp 1800w"
        sizes="(max-width: 620px) calc(100vw - 44px), 46vw"
        width="1800"
        height="1350"
        loading="lazy"
        alt="Coordinate measuring machine measuring a manufactured sample"
      />
      <figcaption>
        Coordinate measurement supports experimental evaluation.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Experimental capabilities</p>
      <h2>Research grounded in making and measuring.</h2>
      <p>
        ARMS brings together CNC machining, directed energy deposition, and
        measurement to investigate manufacturing processes and equipment.
        Students learn through hands-on experimental work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" id="mission">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p>
    <h2>Advance manufacturing. Develop researchers.</h2>
    <div class="three">
      <div>
        <h3>A supportive research team</h3>
        <p>
          Build an open-minded, friendly environment where people share
          knowledge, take initiative, and grow through collaboration.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Research shaped by industrial needs</h3>
        <p>
          Work with collaborators on real manufacturing problems, pursuing
          results that benefit industry, academia, and society.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Learning through hands-on research</h3>
        <p>
          Help students develop skills and independent judgment through training
          and experimental research.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Industry collaboration</p>
    <h2>Start with a manufacturing challenge.</h2>
    <p>
      Discuss research questions related to manufacturing software, machining,
      or hybrid processes.
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:msoshi@ucdavis.edu">Contact Professor Soshi →</a>
  </section>
</Base>
